<title>USA: Avid Tech names William Flaherty CFO.</title>
<headline>Avid Tech names William Flaherty CFO.</headline>
<dateline>TEWKSBURY, Mass. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avid Technology Inc said on Monday that it named William Flaherty vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Flaherty has served as senior vice president of finance and chief financial officer of Gibson Greetings Inc.  </p>
<p>The company said Flaherty will replace Jonathan Cook, who served as Avid's vice president of finance and chief financial since 1992.  Cook will resign at the end of September.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
